Base rate: no nicotine pouch/tobacco-adjacent brand has ever aired a Super Bowl ad; category essentially 0% historically. Market price of 8% reflects some low-probability chatter but no confirmed buy. Lack of any leaked advertiser list mention just 10 days out is strong negative evidence, since major Super Bowl advertisers are typically known by this point. No adjustment upward justified given absence of corroborating signal; regulatory/PR risk further suppresses likelihood.

Sticking close to base rate, slightly below market price given lack of confirmation this close to game day.

