Election already occurred; Freedom Movement won plurality (28.63% vs 27.95%), a clear first-place finish. "Win the election" most naturally refers to winning the most votes/seats, which is confirmed. Government formation uncertainty is a separate question from "winning the election" per typical resolution criteria for such markets.

Consistency: 95 out of 100 times, given this reported plurality result, the market would resolve YES on "won the election" phrasing, with small residual uncertainty about recount/dispute or resolution criteria requiring government formation.

